<http://data.silknow.org/object/b59e31cb-1f55-35a8-8e4d-d1a172d08dac>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural linen sampler, upper half embroidered with polychrome alphabets in cross and eyelet stitches; lower half embroidered with wide bands of small plant forms and birds along with geometric work; thicker band flanked by cypress trees in pots and small peacocks; decorative borders throughout. Stitches: counted satin, cross, double running, eyelet, Gobelin, long-armed cross, Montenegrin cross, rice, satin, two-sided cross."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a8beb49a-6055-3049-8f4d-0c11b561cc18> ;
